<article class="acw-page" data-ac-page-section="public-for-patients" data-ac-acw-screen="ACW05">
  <section class="acw-hero">
    <div>
      <p class="acw-kicker">For patients</p>
      <h1>Take control of your healthcare journey.</h1>
      <p class="acw-hero__lede">ActiveClinic helps you find clinics that have published a public listing. Online booking is available only at participating clinics, and staff review each request.</p>
      <p class="ac-public-actions">
        <a class="ac-btn ac-btn--primary" href="/clinics">Find a Clinic Near You</a>
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="acw-hero__media">
      <%- include('../partials/ac-media', {
        src: '/activeclinic/assets/platform/home-hero.jpg',
        alt: '',
        decorative: true,
        className: 'acp-hero__image',
        objectFit: 'cover',
        objectPosition: 'center 35%',
        aspect: '16 / 10',
        width: 960,
        height: 600,
        loading: 'lazy',
      }) %>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="acw-section">
    <header class="acw-section-header">
      <h2>How ActiveClinic works for you</h2>
    </header>
    <div class="acw-grid acw-grid--3">
      <article class="acw-card">
        <h3>Discover clinics</h3>
        <p>Search published clinics by name, location, or listed services. Unpublished clinics never appear.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="acw-card">
        <h3>Read clinic information</h3>
        <p>Each public website shows what that clinic published — services, doctors, hours, and contact details can differ.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="acw-card">
        <h3>Request a visit where enabled</h3>
        <p>If a clinic offers online booking, you submit a request. That is not an instant confirmed slot.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="acw-section acw-section--band">
    <div class="acw-section__inner">
      <h2>Patient accounts</h2>
      <p>Some clinics offer a patient portal for that clinic only. Booking history and reminders depend on what the clinic enables. We do not claim a single national patient record.</p>
      <ul class="acp-check-list">
        <li>Clinic-scoped sign-in where the clinic has enabled it</li>
        <li>Booking request lookup with the link the clinic provides</li>
        <li>No medical charts on this public website</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
</article>
